{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaeguahe/panel_household

    The file of a household, in one screen at 1366: since when it waits and who looks after them, the promise that is
    due; the children hanging on the wall, each with its way; the conversation, the old messages folded in one line and
    the last two in sight, and at the end «Your turn» with what the centre already said, the draft with its owner, the
    channel and «What comes next». At the side the proposal, in one sentence that starts with what holds it, and one
    button that writes the answer (it never sends by itself); who writes and how; what they answered and what they have
    not told yet; their events, their page and their data. The same page is the sheet beside the inbox: the script takes
    [data-hoja] from it, and the CSS folds the side under the conversation.

    New in this round: url, inboxurl, answered, owner, takeurl, ownedbyme, promise, typing, historyold, hasold, oldlabel,
    composer.greeting, composer.draft, composer.suggestions, composer.next, proposal, noproposal, untold, hasuntold,
    untoldtext, hasabout, mergeurl. Kept: everything of 0.15. Drawn only when they exist (Eguahe, 8 November 2026,
    until Enrique says yes to them): relay (who attends the family, «Quién la atiende», and the promise), composer.next and mergeurl.
    Round 2: the file is one grid (the handover, the wall, the conversation, what to do, the rest); «Your turn» is a
    section of its own beside the proposal, which climbs to the right column from 1280 px, and its stamp has a place of
    its own in the head of the pad (turno-cab), never over the text. Below 1000 px the grid is one column, in this order;
    where the stamp does not fit beside the title, it goes under it.

